  "facts": [
    "The Atlantic Bridge, unveiled on 2 August 2019, boasts a 530‑metre main span, making it the longest cable‑stayed span in Panama and the third permanent crossing of the canal.",
    "Designed by China Communication Construction and built by Vinci Construction, the bridge’s construction began in January 2013 and the main span was keyed on 6 September 2018, a milestone celebrated by President Laurentino Cortizo.",
    "By replacing the nearby Panama Canal Ferry, the Atlantic Bridge links Bolivar Highway on the east to the undeveloped western area, becoming the only bridge north of the Culebra Cut."
